{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build a magical town and uncover wandering spirits.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Spiritstead, you\u2019ll arrive in a quiet, enchanted land where humans and magical spirits work together to build a thriving town. Gather resources, care for your villagers, and discover magical spirits as you shape your own world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build &amp; Expand:</strong> Gather food, wood, and gold to grow your town. Expand lands, build buildings, and add decorations to bring the village to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Villager Care:</strong> Keep everyone fed, assign jobs, and make them happy with cafes, markets, and other happiness buildings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress &amp; Unlocks:</strong> Level up to unlock new buildings, decorations, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spirits &amp; Magic:</strong> Discover and collect hidden spirits, collect magical shards, and unlock spirit buildings to add life to your town.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/f98d6bf01c8688837e19d88b41af0aab.poster.avif?t=1772835922\" width=800 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/f98d6bf01c8688837e19d88b41af0aab.webm?t=1772835922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/f98d6bf01c8688837e19d88b41af0aab.mp4?t=1772835922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Mode</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design &amp; Decorate:</strong> Create freely without limits. Focus on building, decorating, and shaping your dream magical town.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/38364ca64b8dc2e8b9aa2dd214234194.poster.avif?t=1772835922\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/38364ca64b8dc2e8b9aa2dd214234194.webm?t=1772835922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/38364ca64b8dc2e8b9aa2dd214234194.mp4?t=1772835922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath its cozy atmosphere lie hidden secrets waiting to be discovered as you expand into further territories with the help of wandering spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2764\ufe0f Wishlist Spiritstead on Steam to support us and get notified when the full game releases!\u00a0\u2764\ufe0f</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501540?t=1772835922","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501540?t=1772835922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/742ba711f44415793204adf8338d482a90d3af03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772835922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/742ba711f44415793204adf8338d482a90d3af03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772835922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],